+// in case MT and PACKING_ONE_SLICE_PER_LAYER, MAX_SLICES_NUM should not be exceeding MAX_LAYER_NUM_OF_FRAME
+// for AVC cases, maximal resolution we can support up to (?x1024) for SM_ROWMB_SLICE slice mode
